WEBVTT

00:00.120 --> 00:02.006
Great ideas happen in meetings.

00:02.720 --> 00:04.315
But context gets lost.

00:05.220 --> 00:09.305
Meet Briefnest. A native Mac
workspace for the work that follows.

00:11.150 --> 00:13.728
Capture a meeting, or import a recording.

00:15.650 --> 00:17.582
Keep the words alongside the slides.

00:20.150 --> 00:22.936
Turn that conversation
into notes you can edit.

00:24.000 --> 00:27.111
Review the decisions and
next steps. Then approve.

00:28.120 --> 00:30.405
Give each action an owner and a deadline.

00:32.080 --> 00:35.108
When the code is merged,
review the suggested update.

00:36.150 --> 00:41.810
Decisions keep their history. From five retries
to three, the reasoning stays with the work.

00:43.110 --> 00:45.056
Why did we change the retry limit?

00:46.300 --> 00:49.446
Ask your workspace. Follow the
answer back to the meeting.

00:51.050 --> 00:55.408
Bring context to your coding agents.
Share selected knowledge with your team.

00:56.030 --> 00:58.878
Briefnest. Where conversations
connect to the work.
